    "### Sentence Transformer\n",
    "\n",
    "To capture semantic relationships beyond exact word matching, a **pre-trained Sentence Transformer** model (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`) is used to generate dense vector embeddings for the question prompt and each of the five answer options.\n",
    "\n",
    "For each question, embeddings are generated for the prompt and all answer choices. The embeddings are **L2-normalized**, allowing the **dot product** between vectors to represent **cosine similarity**. Each answer option is then ranked according to its similarity to the prompt, and the **top three most similar options** are selected as the final predictions.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model is evaluated on the training dataset using the **MAP@3** metric and compared against the Majority Baseline and TF-IDF baseline. Finally, predictions for the test dataset are generated and exported in the required Kaggle submission format."
