    "## Dense Retrieval using FAISS\n",
    "\n",
    "Given a question, we first generate its embedding using the Sentence Transformer model. The embedding is then used to query the FAISS index, retrieving the top-k most semantically similar documents from the knowledge base. These retrieved documents serve as candidate contexts for the subsequent reranking stage."
