    "## Model Training\n",
    "\n",
    "The model was trained using **EarlyStopping** and **ModelCheckpoint** callbacks to improve generalization and avoid unnecessary training.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. EarlyStopping\n",
    "\n",
    "The EarlyStopping callback monitors the validation loss during training. If the validation loss does not improve for several consecutive epochs, the training process is stopped automatically. This helps prevent overfitting and reduces unnecessary computation.\n",
    "\n",
    "The best model weights are restored automatically after training.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. ModelCheckpoint\n",
    "\n",
    "The ModelCheckpoint callback saves the model whenever the validation loss improves. This ensures that the best-performing model is preserved, even if subsequent epochs lead to overfitting.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Training Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "- Optimizer: Adam\n",
